div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\mathcal E,K,\\pi\\in V\">\\(E,\\mathcal E,K,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3MarkovKernel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c9ac9c993a94d32\" href=\"?note=5c9ac9c993a94d32\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob3-markov-kernel.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> is the probability-measure predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StationaryDistribution}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StationaryDistribution}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_E f\\,d\\pi\">\\(\\int_E f\\,d\\pi\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 的非负 Lebesgue 积分，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为完整函数图；核的截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle x,K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in E\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle x,K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in E\\}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span> 时取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" 